{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文於節目中推介中生製藥(1177)，指公司逐步轉型做創新藥，中期業績顯示創新藥及授權收入大增，並佔總收入比例近一半，加上近期憧憬美國放寬投資中國藥企，中短線都有利好因素。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文建議5.8元可以買入，於節目中改為現價即5.78元買入，目標價上望6.3元，若失守4.5元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wQfd1fJYwU1790147262.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中生製藥(1177)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$5.8→$5.78</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$6.3</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$4.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦推介立訊精密(2475)，一來有蘋果概念股，二市場預期蘋果新手機銷售熾熱，相關業務有望帶動盈利增長，二來公司有經營數據中心業務，業績顯示收入及盈利繼續擴張，反映集團收入多元化。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026XLZCwEV99a1790147288.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦建議現價即59.3元便可買入，目標價看72元，止蝕價定於52元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026iJbSmpsrkw1790147312.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">立訊精密(2475)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：現價→$59.3</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$72</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$52</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T07:38:40.573250+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":368,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}